LOGBOOK.md:1178:- VERIFICATION: The checksum-locked static XCFramework is a SwiftPM binary target for the shared native adapter and all provider/harness graphs. Generated and statically embedded HEV/core/task-system/lwIP notices are byte-identical and trace every manifest revision; the stripped harness audit requires HEV main/quit/stats symbols.
